<section id="about" class="about-scene shell" aria-labelledby="about-title"><div class="about-intro"><h2 id="about-title">Close to the tool.<br />Curious about<br />the edges.</h2><div><p class="large-copy">I’m nohint404. My public work moves between the development environment and the browser.</p><p>In vs-notrack, I work through editor settings and extension state. In Monolith, I contribute to controls and the feedback around them. Here, the interface itself gets to be a toy.</p><p>Linux is part of how I work. The shortcuts and direct feedback stayed. The wall of terminal green didn’t.</p></div></div><div id="stack" class="stack-section"><h3>Things I actually use</h3><div class="stack-ledger">{projects.map(project => <details><summary>{project.technologies.join(' / ')}<span>{project.name}</span></summary><p>{project.summary}</p><a href={`/work/${project.slug}/`}>See the implementation in {project.name}</a></details>)}</div></div></section>
